+## Request 18: Late Fees (Completed)
+- Added `lateFee(invoice, asOf)` function to src/reports.js:
+  - Calculates late fee for an overdue invoice
+  - Returns 0 if invoice is not overdue (dueDate >= asOf)
+  - Fee calculation: amount due * 0.0004 * days overdue
+    - 0.04% per day (0.0004 rate)
+    - days overdue = daysBetween(dueDate, asOf)
+    - amount due = balanceDue(invoice) (includes payment history)
+  - Result rounded with roundCents() and clamped to 0
+  - Accumulates over time (fee grows each day past due date)
+- Added 11 new late fee tests covering:
+  - Not overdue and before due date (returns 0)
+  - Single day overdue and multiple days
+  - Partial and full payments
+  - Fully paid invoices (returns 0)
+  - Discounted invoices
+  - Voucher-applied invoices
+  - Large amounts
+  - Different payment terms (NET14, NET30)
+  - Rounding behavior
+- All 217 tests pass (206 existing + 11 new late fee tests)
+
 ## Constraints Followed
 - Money stored as integer cents
 - Never throw; use fail() for errors
